[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10500.07, "timestamp": "02:55:00", "text": "是啊是啊，我在这方面很差劲，我看不懂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10505.03, "timestamp": "02:55:05", "text": "这很好，因为我们可以理解"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10506.95, "timestamp": "02:55:06", "text": "没关系。谁在乎呢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10510.309, "timestamp": "02:55:10", "text": "写作？所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10512.95, "timestamp": "02:55:12", "text": "好的。所以，目前来说，那将是日语"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10515.429, "timestamp": "02:55:15", "text": "这将是你的第三语言。日本人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10519.51, "timestamp": "02:55:19", "text": "这将是我的第四个。第四。好的。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10522.15, "timestamp": "02:55:22", "text": "第三个是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10525.19, "timestamp": "02:55:25", "text": "印地语嘛，我不太懂，但我仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10528.15, "timestamp": "02:55:28", "text": "我研究过，所以能理解一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10531.51, "timestamp": "02:55:31", "text": "然后，呃，英语也在那里。第三。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10533.11, "timestamp": "02:55:33", "text": "是的，英语现在已经有了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10535.349, "timestamp": "02:55:35", "text": "就像这一代人的一半。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10537.19, "timestamp": "02:55:37", "text": "就像我们这一代的一半"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10539.349, "timestamp": "02:55:39", "text": "这一代人已经习惯用英语思考了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10542.95, "timestamp": "02:55:42", "text": "就像你知道的那样，它开始运转了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10545.99, "timestamp": "02:55:45", "text": "在某个时候情况有所不同。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10547.83, "timestamp": "02:55:47", "text": "是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10551.51, "timestamp": "02:55:51", "text": "对我来说，说实话，M 就是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10555.91, "timestamp": "02:55:55", "text": "能读写旁遮普语和印地语"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10559.51, "timestamp": "02:55:59", "text": "呃，英语。我的英语很流利。"}]